<title>USA: Maine Turnpike sets hearings on widening road.</title>
<headline>Maine Turnpike sets hearings on widening road.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Feb 10 (Reuter) The Maine Turnpike Authority holds the first of several public hearings this week on plans to widen the 99-mile, toll highway.</p>
<p>The authority is considering widening the turnpike only along the southernmost segment in York County, but the plan is being opposed by environmental groups.</p>
<p>The issue may end up being decided by the legislature... or at another referendum. Voters defeated a similar plan in 1991.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
